      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#8FD0EA;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">Service Area</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Turbine and Generator Services in Abuja and the Federal Capital Territory</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Abuja signs off on the outages that happen everywhere else, and runs one of the densest standby generation fleets in the country while it does. We support both sides: proposal grade scoping for plants in the field, and hands on service for FCT sites.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
