<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Abuja is where Nigerian power decisions are made before they are executed anywhere else. The Federal Capital Territory holds the head offices of NNPC Limited, the Federal Ministry of Power, the Nigerian Electricity Regulatory Commission, the Transmission Company of Nigeria and the Rural Electrification Agency, along with most of the independent power producers, holding companies and EPC contractors active in the market. An overhaul that will physically happen in Rivers, Delta or Kogi is still scoped, tendered and approved by people sitting in the Central Business District, and the technical proposal has to survive evaluation there before a single casing is opened.</p><p>The territory also carries a heavy standby load of its own. Federal ministries, the tertiary hospitals in AMAC and Gwagwalada, colocation data centres, bank head offices, hotels, malls, the airport and the light industry around Idu all sit behind diesel sets ranging from 100 kVA to well past 2,000 kVA, most of them idle for long stretches and then asked to pick up full building load without notice. We work both sides of that reality, combining <a href="/generator-maintenance-nigeria/">generator maintenance</a> and load verification for FCT sites with <a href="/steam-turbine-overhaul-nigeria/">turbine overhaul</a> scoping and documentation for owners whose machines sit hundreds of kilometres away.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Abuja</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Abuja Plants</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Standby Generator Maintenance and Overhaul</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Scheduled servicing, top overhauls and full engine rebuilds for the diesel fleets behind FCT ministries, hospitals, data centres and bank head offices. Every scope includes load bank verification, because a set that has not seen real load since the last rainy season has not been proven.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Gas and Steam Turbine Overhaul Scoping</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Combustion inspections, hot gas path inspections and major overhauls planned for Abuja based owners and IPPs whose units operate in the Niger Delta, the North West or along the Kogi corridor. Borescope findings, clearance records and parts lead times are written up in a form your evaluation committee can score line by line.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Plant Condition and Energy Audits</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Independent condition, heat rate and specific fuel consumption audits built for budget defence, tender preparation and capital planning cycles that run on the federal calendar. You receive a ranked intervention list with Naira costs and the technical basis for each figure.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Rotating Equipment Services</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Laser shaft alignment, in situ field balancing, vibration analysis and bearing renewal on pumps, fans, blowers and air compressors across FCT water treatment, hospital plant rooms, hotels and process facilities. Baselines are recorded so the next reading means something.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
